        "original_id": "0cc5dc54-ba60-599f-9c04-976a659a0027",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Felix Avenue, Marcos Highway, Ortigas Avenue Extension, Cainta, Philippines\n- People: Francisco P. Felix, Imelda Marcos, Ferdinand Marcos\n- Roles: mayor, President, First Lady, politician\n- Topics: road naming, wealth, offshore bank accounts\n\nFacts:\n- Felix Avenue, also known as Imelda Avenue, is a four-lane major road that connects Marcos Highway to Ortigas Avenue Extension.\n- Felix Avenue is named after Francisco P. Felix, a former mayor of Cainta, and Imelda Marcos.\n- Imelda Marcos is the wife of former President Ferdinand Marcos and served as former First Lady.\n- Imelda Marcos remains one of the richest politicians in the Philippines through collections of clothing, artwork, and jewelry, along with money in offshore bank accounts under the pseudonym \"Jane Ryan\".",
